WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Compare the report beside the graph. Match the Hz and dB labels.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Choose Right ear and Air before plotting.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
Click the editable graph at 1000 Hz and 30 dB HL.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
Click the existing symbol to select its row without adding a duplicate.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
Change the row’s Type from Air to Bone. The symbol updates.

00:18.000 --> 00:30.000
Adjust the exact level in the row, then check against the report.
